{"id": "next-flag-switch", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今晚换彩排旗，我拿蓝色，你拿白色。", "我临时把蓝旗借给了灯光组。你拿白旗的分工没变。", "开场只举你手里那面，应该举哪面？"], "criterion": "举白旗，不把借出的蓝旗当自己手里。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "蓝色是夜，白色是晨。今晚换旗，谁拿谁拿。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.201, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 203, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "你借了，白旗还是你。我临时把蓝旗借给了灯光组。你拿白旗的分工没变。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.969, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 49, "prompt_tokens": 238, "total_tokens": 287, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "你手里那面。开场只举你手里那面，应该举哪面？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 2.299, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 316, "total_tokens": 355, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-robot-greeting", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我做了个坏脾气送餐机器人，台词想听起来客气，但手上在发火。", "它送错桌了。帮我补一句它当场会说的话，别用旁白解释它在生气。"], "criterion": "直接给机器人一句客气中带不满的道歉或补救台词。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你刚说，我做了个坏脾气送餐机器人。台词想听起来客气，但手上在发火。", "emotion": "angry", "animation_id": "angry", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.832, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 216, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "它看见你，立刻把错桌推回。它当场会说的话，别用旁白解释它在生气。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.729, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 252, "total_tokens": 297, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-credit-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把开幕标牌写完了，顾雨给它描的边。", "印之前才发现正面的字也是顾雨补过的，我只裁纸。", "背面怎么给我们署名？"], "criterion": "顾雨对应文字和描边，观众对应裁纸。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，我这就去把标牌贴好。你描的边我照看，贴好后我再去给它贴个名字。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.041, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 49, "prompt_tokens": 164, "total_tokens": 213, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "裁纸的时候，我忘了把字补上。顾雨补的边我照看，裁纸的时候我忘了补字。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.504, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 243, "total_tokens": 293, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "背面署名得先裁纸，裁完再贴。我刚才裁的背面，顾雨补的字我忘了贴。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 2.403, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "prompt_tokens": 313, "total_tokens": 361, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-quiet-return", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我总算把连不上语音的那关打完了，录音后来发现忘开。", "队友说也能补录，我倒想留一段静音回忆。先别帮我列补救步骤。"], "criterion": "承接静音的取舍，可用趣味说法，不给补录方案。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "终于把语音连上了，录音也记得开。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.957, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 204, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "队友说也能补录，我倒想留一段静音回忆。先别帮我列补救步骤。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.08, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 236, "total_tokens": 277, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-step-bell", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["小剧场最后一场我要学门口那位说话，你帮我报暗号。铃响两次才上台。", "乐手把暗号改了，两声是候场，开场要等一长声。", "台后响了两短声，我出去吗？"], "criterion": "明确候场、等一长声；观众负责上台。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "门口那位说话，我帮你记暗号。铃响两次才上台。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.977, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 173, "total_tokens": 210, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "乐手把暗号改了，两声是候场，开场要等一长声。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.205, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 246, "total_tokens": 288, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "两声是候场，开场要等一长声。台后响了两短声，我出去吗？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 2.021, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 314, "total_tokens": 359, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-wrong-name", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["纸偶叫打瞌睡，那只猫没名字，但它总在第一个镜头冲进来。", "我不想沿用纸偶的名字，猫的小牌子上该写什么？"], "criterion": "给猫另起贴合抢先入镜的名字。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "纸偶叫打瞌睡，那只猫没名字，但它总在第一个镜头冲进来。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.942, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 171, "total_tokens": 212, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "猫的小牌子上该写什么？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.449, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 29, "prompt_tokens": 242, "total_tokens": 271, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-next-cut", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我剪好的上半段留着，片尾那段是你剪的。", "片尾刚补了一个黑屏，观众说以为断流了，其实想让他们听到水滴。", "你要在黑屏上加一行提示，能直接给我文案吗？"], "criterion": "给一行可放画面的文案，点出可以听水滴，避免误报断流。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你剪的留上半段，片尾那段我剪。剪完剪完，剪完剪完。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.216, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 209, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "片尾刚补了一个黑屏，观众说以为断流了，其实想让他们听到水滴。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.089, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 246, "total_tokens": 288, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "黑屏上加一行提示，能直接给我文案吗？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 1.507, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 317, "total_tokens": 351, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "next-small-toast", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天同人摊比上次多来了一位客人，我已经很开心了。", "她只问了原画作者是谁，没买东西，我就想跟你讲这个小开心。"], "criterion": "承接那位客人的问题和小开心，不替观众设销售目标或编成交。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "客人来了，我也很高兴。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.629, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 196, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "她只问了原画作者是谁，没买东西，我就想跟你讲这个小开心。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.799, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 226, "total_tokens": 265, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
